assertion A1 : pre_pkg__sim::Arduino is deadlock-free

assertion A2 : pre_pkg__sim::RaspberryPi is deadlock-free 

simulation RC of Arduino{
	cycleDef cycle==1
}
 
assertion A3: pre_pkg__sim::Arduino refines RC  in the traces model with cycleDef of RC set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg__sim::Arduino set to 1 
assertion A4: RC refines pre_pkg__sim::Arduino  in the traces model with cycleDef of RC set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg__sim::Arduino set to 1 

simulation RCRaspberryPi of RaspberryPi{
	cycleDef cycle == 1
} 

assertion A5: pre_pkg__sim::RaspberryPi refines RCRaspberryPi  in the traces model with cycleDef of RCRaspberryPi set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg__sim::RaspberryPi set to 1 
assertion A6: RCRaspberryPi refines pre_pkg__sim::RaspberryPi  in the traces model with cycleDef of RCRaspberryPi set to 1, and cycleDef of pre_pkg__sim::RaspberryPi set to 1 